<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>EasyLabel Bulk Template Upload</title><style>body{font:15px system-ui;background:#f4f7fc;color:#182538;margin:0}.wrap{max-width:760px;margin:48px auto;background:white;padding:32px;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 10px 35px #14213d13}h1{margin:0 0 8px}p{color:#667085}button{background:#1769ff;color:white;border:0;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:9px;cursor:pointer}input{margin:22px 0}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#f1f5f9;padding:18px;border-radius:10px}</style></head><body><main class="wrap"><a href="/" style="text-decoration:none;color:#1769ff">← EasyLabel Admin</a><h1 style="margin-top:16px">Bulk Template Upload</h1><p>Upload one ZIP with up to 200 EasyLabel EPL templates (.txt or .json). Files remain <b>pending</b> and hidden from regular Android users until the Master Admin configures and publishes each template.</p><form id="f"><input type="file" name="file" accept=".zip" required><br><button>Upload to Pending</button></form><pre id="result">Select a ZIP to begin.</pre><hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid #eee;margin:30px 0"><h2>Master Admin Phones</h2><p>Generate a single-use activation code for each phone. Codes expire in 10 minutes. Keep this private page and its URL secret.</p><label>Phone name <input id="phoneName" placeholder="e.g. Office phone" maxlength="80"></label><button type="button" id="generateCode">Generate Activation Code</button><pre id="activationCode">No activation code generated.</pre><button type="button" id="refreshDevices">Refresh Authorized Phones</button><div id="devices"></div>
<script>
const bulkAccess=()=>new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('access')||'';
async function adminDeviceRequest(path,method='GET',body){const r=await fetch('/api/template-bulk'+path,{method,headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json','X-Template-Bulk-Token':bulkAccess()},body:body?JSON.stringify(body):undefined});const j=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw Error(j.message||'Request failed');return j;}
document.getElementById('generateCode').onclick=async()=>{const el=document.getElementById('activationCode');try{const j=await adminDeviceRequest('/devices/codes','POST',{name:document.getElementById('phoneName').value||'Master phone'});el.textContent='Activation code (expires in 10 minutes):\n'+j.code+'\n\nEnter this code in EasyLabel Android → Master Template Management.';}catch(e){el.textContent=e.message}};
async function refreshMasterDevices(){const box=document.getElementById('devices');box.textContent='Loading...';try{const j=await adminDeviceRequest('/devices');box.replaceChildren();for(const d of j.devices){const row=document.createElement('p');row.textContent=d.name+' — '+(d.revokedAt?'REVOKED':'ACTIVE')+' — Last used: '+(d.lastUsedAt?new Date(d.lastUsedAt).toLocaleString():'Never')+' ';if(!d.revokedAt){const btn=document.createElement('button');btn.textContent='Revoke';btn.onclick=async()=>{if(!confirm('Revoke this phone?'))return;try{await adminDeviceRequest('/devices/'+encodeURIComponent(d._id)+'/revoke','POST');refreshMasterDevices()}catch(e){alert(e.message)}};row.appendChild(btn)}box.appendChild(row)}if(!j.devices.length)box.textContent='No phones activated yet.'}catch(e){box.textContent=e.message}}
document.getElementById('refreshDevices').onclick=refreshMasterDevices;
</script><p>Master Admin Android endpoints: <code>GET /api/template-bulk/pending</code> and <code>PATCH /api/template-bulk/:id/publish</code>.</p></main><script>document.getElementById('f').onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();const o=document.getElementById('result');o.textContent='Uploading...';try{const access=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('access')||'';const headers=access?{'X-Template-Bulk-Token':access}:{};const r=await fetch('/api/template-bulk/upload',{method:'POST',headers,body:new FormData(e.target)});o.textContent=JSON.stringify(await r.json(),null,2)}catch(err){o.textContent=err.message}}</script></body></html>